msgstr "Appearance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "皮肤白皙，小巧玲珑，脸颊泛红，鼻子上有看起来很可爱的小雀斑"
msgstr ""
"Fair skin, petite and delicate, rosy cheeks, with cute little freckles on"
" her nose"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "头发"
msgstr "Hair"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "黑色短发，编着几根彩辫"
msgstr "Black short hair with a few colorful braids"

