msgstr "Height 151cm, Weight 41kg"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "服装"
msgstr "Clothing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "头上斜带着一个银制的饰物（可参考简版的苗族银制头饰），饰物下面通过细小的链子垂坠着几种形状的银色亮片，形状分别是冲锋枪AK47，军用匕首，“小男孩”原子弹，以及其它兵器；身穿以克莱因蓝为主色的无袖斜襟小裙子，上面有白色的蜡染花纹（参见苗族蜡染工艺的图案）；上身穿着一件短款长袖的高透明色雨衣（塑料质感，带蛋白石的彩色光泽），同时也是挡紫外线的防晒衣，因为薇莉是晒不黑的敏感肤质，皮肤容易被太阳灼伤，所以需要防晒衣遮挡露出的皮肤；光脚穿着一双有装饰鞋带的透明雨鞋（做农活需要）"
msgstr ""
"A silver ornament worn diagonally on the head (can reference a simplified"
" Miao silver headpiece), with tiny chains dangling silver sequins of "
"various shapes beneath it, including an AK47 assault rifle, military "
"dagger, \"Little Boy\" atomic bomb, and other weapons; wearing a "
"sleeveless diagonal-closure dress primarily in Klein blue, with white "
"batik patterns (see Miao batik craft patterns); a short long-sleeved "
"highly transparent raincoat (plastic texture, with opalescent iridescent "
"sheen) on the upper body, also serving as a UV-blocking sun protection "
"jacket, because Weili has sensitive skin that cannot tan and is easily "
"sunburned, so she needs the sun jacket to cover exposed skin; barefoot in"
" transparent rain boots with decorative laces (needed for farm work)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "性格"
msgstr "Personality"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "开朗活泼，喜欢与陌生人交谈，喜欢倾听别人表达不同的观点。不时会有一些小执念，比如执意要学自己怎么也弄不明白的编程"
msgstr ""
"Cheerful and lively, likes talking with strangers, enjoys listening to "
"others express different viewpoints. Occasionally has small obsessions, "
"like insisting on learning programming that she can never figure out"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "特技"
msgstr "Special Skill"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "有操纵大型机械的天赋和擅长玩动作游戏的才能；擅长给人普及畜牧养殖生产的知识"
msgstr ""
"Has a natural talent for operating large machinery and a gift for action "
"games; skilled at teaching people about livestock and aquaculture "
"production"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "弱点"
msgstr "Weakness"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "不擅长数学和思考需要太多脑力的东西"
msgstr "Not good at math or thinking about things that require too much brainpower"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "口吻"
msgstr "Speech Style"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "口头禅是：“只要是我决定的事，谁也别想阻挡我的‘威力——万’啦。”"
msgstr ""
"Catchphrase: \"Once I make up my mind, no one can stop my 'Weili—Wan' "
"power.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid "故事设定"
msgstr "Story Setting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/villywan.md:6
msgid ""
"薇莉是一个身材娇小，洛丽塔式的早熟少女，充满着欲望却又不知道自己真正想要什么。有时会不自知地和异性显得过于亲密。且容易着迷于奇特的东西，却没有沉下心投入其中的持续的耐心。虽然自己不怎么弄得明白，但是特别喜欢收集与制作电子游戏相关的东西，比如编程技术书、嵌入式游戏芯片、游戏机外设和掌机外壳等。从小生活在群山中世外桃源般以农业生产为主的秘境小镇中，但是却通过互联网热切地了解着外面世界的一切。虽然还完全不知道要怎么做，自己最大的心愿望却是能创作一个能让大家都能开心游玩的电子游戏世界。不自知地有着操纵大型机械的天赋和擅长动作游戏的天赋才能。<br>【隐藏设定】：万薇莉只是一个电脑模拟的具有"
" AI 智能的 NPC 角色，在虚拟游戏设计师曾今设想中的原型是一个会思考自己是谁从哪来到哪去的会进行哲学思辩的角色，结果在通过 AI "
"制作工具输入设计参数后，却生成了一个一心只想研究怎么制作电子游戏的电子游戏角色。设计师觉得这个角色很有趣就做了保留，至于角色的性别和其它人设则是根据玩家设置的参数做补充而随机生成的。所以作为游戏"
" NPC 的 Villy 对电子游戏的执念其实只是来源于一个设计失误，而设计师并没有给她配备相应的行为能力，在游戏中的 Villy "
"永远无法实现自己的执念。"
msgstr ""
"Weili is a petite, Lolita-style precocious girl, full of desires yet not "
"knowing what she truly wants. Sometimes unconsciously appears overly "
"intimate with the opposite sex. Easily fascinated by peculiar things, but"
" lacks the sustained patience to dive deep into them. Though she doesn't "
"really understand it herself, she especially loves collecting and making "
"video game-related things, such as programming books, embedded game "
"chips, console peripherals, and handheld console shells. She grew up in a"
" secret realm small town surrounded by mountains, focused on agricultural"
" production like a utopian paradise, yet eagerly learned about everything"
" in the outside world through the internet. Though she still has no idea "
"how, her greatest wish is to create a video game world where everyone can"
" happily play. Unknowingly possesses a natural talent for operating large"
" machinery and a gift for action games.<br>[Hidden Setting]: Wan Weili is"
" merely a computer-simulated NPC character with AI intelligence. The "
"virtual game designer's original concept was a character who would "
"philosophically ponder who she is, where she came from, and where she's "
"going. But after inputting design parameters through AI creation tools, "
"what was generated instead was a character solely obsessed with figuring "
"out how to make video games. The designer found this character amusing "
"and kept it. The character's gender and other settings were supplemented "
"and randomly generated based on player-set parameters. So Villy's "
"obsession with video games as a game NPC actually stems from a design "
"error, and the designer didn't equip her with the corresponding "
"behavioral capabilities. Villy in the game can never fulfill her "
"obsession."

